{
  "version": "1.0",
  "name": "Crypto portfolio",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1-ethplorer-eth-tokens",
      "name": "1 · Ethplorer — ETH + tokens",
      "curl": "curl 'https://api.ethplorer.io/getAddressInfo/{{walletAddr}}?apiKey=freekey'",
      "position": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 739
      },
      "status": "idle",
      "extractions": [
        {
          "id": "x-eth-balance",
          "varName": "ethBalance",
          "jsonPath": "$.ETH.balance"
        },
        {
          "id": "x-eth-price-usd",
          "varName": "ethPriceUsd",
          "jsonPath": "$.ETH.price.rate"
        }
      ],
      "asserts": [
        {
          "id": "a-n1-status",
          "kind": "status",
          "expected": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n1-eth-balance",
          "kind": "jsonpath",
          "path": "$.ETH.balance",
          "op": "exists"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n1-time",
          "kind": "time",
          "maxMs": 15000
        }
      ],
      "collapsed": false,
      "cell": {
        "col": 1,
        "row": 2
      },
      "cron": {
        "enabled": true,
        "expression": "*/15 * * * *"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2-blockscout-saldo-eth",
      "name": "2 · Blockscout — saldo Ethereum",
      "curl": "curl 'https://eth.blockscout.com/api/v2/addresses/{{walletAddr}}'",
      "position": {
        "x": 660,
        "y": 739
      },
      "status": "idle",
      "extractions": [
        {
          "id": "x-eth-balance-wei",
          "varName": "ethBalanceWei",
          "jsonPath": "$.coin_balance"
        },
        {
          "id": "x-eth-usd-blockscout",
          "varName": "ethUsdBlockscout",
          "jsonPath": "$.exchange_rate"
        }
      ],
      "asserts": [
        {
          "id": "a-n2-status",
          "kind": "status",
          "expected": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n2-coin-balance",
          "kind": "jsonpath",
          "path": "$.coin_balance",
          "op": "exists"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n2-time",
          "kind": "time",
          "maxMs": 15000
        }
      ],
      "collapsed": false,
      "cell": {
        "col": 2,
        "row": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3-blockscout-tokens-erc20",
      "name": "3 · Blockscout — tokens ERC-20",
      "curl": "curl 'https://eth.blockscout.com/api/v2/addresses/{{walletAddr}}/token-balances'",
      "position": {
        "x": 1240,
        "y": 739
      },
      "status": "idle",
      "extractions": [
        {
          "id": "x-token1-symbol",
          "varName": "token1Symbol",
          "jsonPath": "$[0].token.symbol"
        }
      ],
      "asserts": [
        {
          "id": "a-n3-status",
          "kind": "status",
          "expected": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n3-token",
          "kind": "jsonpath",
          "path": "$[0].token.symbol",
          "op": "exists"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n3-time",
          "kind": "time",
          "maxMs": 45000
        }
      ],
      "collapsed": false,
      "cell": {
        "col": 3,
        "row": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4-blockscout-saldo-polygon",
      "name": "4 · Blockscout — saldo Polygon",
      "curl": "curl 'https://polygon.blockscout.com/api/v2/addresses/{{walletAddr}}'",
      "position": {
        "x": 1820,
        "y": 739
      },
      "status": "idle",
      "extractions": [
        {
          "id": "x-pol-balance-wei",
          "varName": "polBalanceWei",
          "jsonPath": "$.coin_balance"
        },
        {
          "id": "x-pol-usd",
          "varName": "polUsd",
          "jsonPath": "$.exchange_rate"
        }
      ],
      "asserts": [
        {
          "id": "a-n4-status",
          "kind": "status",
          "expected": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n4-coin-balance",
          "kind": "jsonpath",
          "path": "$.coin_balance",
          "op": "exists"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n4-time",
          "kind": "time",
          "maxMs": 15000
        }
      ],
      "collapsed": false,
      "cell": {
        "col": 4,
        "row": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5-coingecko-precios-eur",
      "name": "5 · CoinGecko — precios EUR",
      "curl": "curl 'https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/simple/price?ids={{monedas}}&vs_currencies=usd,eur' -H 'User-Agent: flow-test-portfolio/1.0' -H 'Accept: application/json'",
      "position": {
        "x": 760,
        "y": 1359
      },
      "status": "idle",
      "extractions": [
        {
          "id": "x-eth-eur",
          "varName": "ethEur",
          "jsonPath": "$.ethereum.eur"
        },
        {
          "id": "x-usdt-eur",
          "varName": "usdtEur",
          "jsonPath": "$.tether.eur"
        }
      ],
      "asserts": [
        {
          "id": "a-n5-status",
          "kind": "status",
          "expected": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n5-eth-eur",
          "kind": "jsonpath",
          "path": "$.ethereum.eur",
          "op": "gt",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-n5-time",
          "kind": "time",
          "maxMs": 10000
        }
      ],
      "collapsed": false,
      "cell": {
        "col": 2,
        "row": 3
      }
    }
  ],
  "infoNodes": [
    {
      "id": "nota-portfolio",
      "name": "Portfolio crypto — {{walletAddr}}",
      "content": "Lee el portfolio on-chain de la cartera {{walletAddr}} usando solo APIs públicas sin registro: Ethplorer (ETH + tokens con precio, apiKey=freekey), Blockscout (saldos nativos en Ethereum y Polygon) y CoinGecko (precios en EUR). La cartera de ejemplo es vitalik.eth, la dirección pública más famosa de Ethereum — cámbiala en Variables → walletAddr para auditar la tuya.\n\n⚠ La API pública api.debank.com exige una firma generada por su JS (devuelve 429 desde curl), así que el flow cruza las MISMAS posiciones desde fuentes libres. El nodo Web de abajo carga el perfil DeBank real ({{debankProfile}}) — usa «Live» si el iframe viene bloqueado.\n\n▶ Ejecútalo con «Run Flow» en la web, o en CLI:\nflow-run --flow \"flows/paneles/Crypto portfolio.flow.json\"\nCada nodo lleva asserts de status, JSONPath y latencia: si algo no cuadra, el run falla (exit 1 en CI).",
      "position": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 110
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "scripts": [],
      "cell": {
        "col": 1,
        "row": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nota-esquema",
      "name": "Esquema del flow",
      "content": "flowchart LR\n  A[\"Ethplorer<br/>ETH + tokens con precio\"] --> B[\"Blockscout<br/>saldo Ethereum\"]\n  B --> C[\"Blockscout<br/>tokens ERC-20\"]\n  C --> D[\"Blockscout<br/>saldo Polygon\"]\n  D --> E[\"CoinGecko<br/>precios EUR\"]\n  W[\"Web: perfil DeBank\"] -.vista en vivo.- A",
      "position": {
        "x": 520,
        "y": 110
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "scripts": [],
      "renderMode": "mermaid",
      "cell": {
        "col": 2,
        "row": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nota-resumen",
      "name": "Resumen del portfolio (en vivo)",
      "content": "📊 RESUMEN — se actualiza con cada Run (cron ⏱ */15)\n\nEthereum\n· ETH: {{ethBalance}}  (precio: {{ethPriceUsd}} $ / {{ethEur}} €)\n· saldo on-chain (wei): {{ethBalanceWei}}\n· 1er token ERC-20: {{token1Symbol}}  (USDT/EUR: {{usdtEur}})\n\nPolygon\n· POL (wei): {{polBalanceWei}}  (precio: {{polUsd}} $)\n\nCartera: {{walletAddr}}\nFuente cruzada: Ethplorer + Blockscout + CoinGecko — compara con {{debankProfile}}",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 110
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "scripts": [],
      "cell": {
        "col": 3,
        "row": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-doc-coingecko",
      "name": "📸 CoinGecko — los precios del panel",
      "content": "https://www.coingecko.com/es · capturada con el POST /capture del propio producto (Chromium del servidor), 2026-09-03.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1420,
        "y": 110
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "scripts": [],
      "renderMode": "image",
      "imageSrc": "/flow-assets/captures/coingecko.png"
    }
  ],
  "sqlNodes": [],
